==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|spelican}}
* {{l|en|spillikin}}, {{l|en|spilliken}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|odt|spelleken|gloss=a small pin}}. Compare {{cog|en|spill}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small peg used for playing a game or for keeping score, as in [[cribbage]].
# {{lb|en|in the plural}} A game played with such pegs, [[pushpin]].
# A [[jackstraw]] or stick in the game of [[pick-up sticks]].
# {{lb|en|in the plural}} The game of [[jackstraw]]s or [[pick-up sticks]].

